      "writtenOn": "2022-03-22T23:02:59Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "So perhaps leave it on for Nivviks, since we are not getting a RAM issue there.\nAs Peter says, just about all the Nissa code uses logging as opposed to CPRINT, and turning it off completely at this stage may hamper our bring-up.\n\nLonger term, we do need to figure out what to do about logging.\nIt would be great if we can determine where the space is going, and maybe implement a custom slimmed down backend that would allow us to continue using the API.",
      "parentUuid": "70134c52_57bb1c19",
      "revId": "42d999f9d42c3875386354b6fead89e1768eae16",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
    {
