      "writtenOn": "2022-03-22T23:08:22Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Looks like we could reduce `LOG_STRDUP_MAX_STRING` and `LOG_STRDUP_BUF_COUNT`, possibly even to 0 for the latter since I don\u0027t think we ever expect to log strings that get constructed dynamically. Turning off `LOG_RUNTIME_FILTERING` might also provide some savings without disabling logging completely.",
      "parentUuid": "a6043be4_d3fc2c2e",
      "revId": "42d999f9d42c3875386354b6fead89e1768eae16",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
